+== "{rvy_topr_insn_ext_name}" Extension for Extracting the Top Bound for Memory Allocators
 
 The {rvy_topr_insn_ext_name} extension adds the <<GCTOP>> instruction to return the top bound of a capability.
 This offers a performance improvement over the software sequence of a saturating add of the results of <<GCBASE>> and <<GCLEN>>, and is useful for memory allocators.
